  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Strengthen institutional &amp; community capacities to drive peacebuildin &amp; access to justice in conflict-affected areas in Colombia</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The main activities of the programme include strengthening institutional and community capacities to effectively drive peacebuilding processes in territories affected by armed conflict. This will be achieved through the implementation of specific protection systems for community leaders and human rights defenders, and by ensuring access to justice for the victims of the conflict. Additionally, the programme will support the creation and development of social cohesion and community development initiatives, promoting the active participation of local communities in rebuilding the social fabric and consolidating peace in their territories. These activities are designed to address both immediate needs and structural challenges, ensuring a sustainable and lasting impact in the affected areas.</narrative>
  </description>
